/// "Always on" torch, shared by the VIN scan and the inspection (photo + live
/// video) screens. Double-tap the torch button on any of them to turn it on;
/// every camera that starts afterwards lights the torch by itself. A single tap
/// is only for the current camera session (that task), and tapping the torch
/// off cancels this too.
///
/// Held in memory only (not saved to disk): it lasts while the app is running
/// and is cleared when the app goes to the background, so it never comes back
/// on its own the next time the app is opened.
class TorchSession {
  static bool alwaysOn = false;
}
